// Question bank of the Agile Software Development exam simulator (index.html).
// Contributions welcome: see "Quizzes" in CONTRIBUTING.md.
//
// Answers follow the course (Rubin, Essential Scrum, and the lab slides), not the Scrum Guide where the two differ.
// Questions and options in English (as the slides), explanations in Italian.
// topic is one of: intro, princ, framework, sprints, req, backlog, est, debt, plan, splan, sexec, review, retro, cicd, test.
//
// MC, one correct answer:  [topic, question, [correct, wrong, wrong, wrong], explanation]
//   the correct answer is ALWAYS the first option: the page shuffles them.
// MULTI, "choose N":       [topic, question, [correct answers], [wrong answers], explanation]
//   write "(choose two)" or "(choose three)" in the question, matching the number of correct answers.
// OPEN:                    [topic, question, [key points of a complete answer]]
//
// Keep the options of a question equally detailed: the right answer must not stand out by its length.
// The questions on Rubin's book, chapter by chapter, are in book.js: a separate pool with its own modes.

// Multiple choice: [topic, question, [correct, wrong, wrong, wrong], explanation]. Options are shuffled at runtime.
